        "created_at": "2023-04-26T22:11:27.464Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I disagree a little with your prioritization,  <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/omegatron\">@Omegatron</a>, in that if there are multiple Mountainous Carapaces in play they can really slow down your progress and I’ll elevate them above the Arboreal Phalanges. Phalanges aren’t too bad because they only hit the hero with the highest HP.</p>",
