        "created_at": "2023-04-26T22:34:12.082Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think there may be a misunderstanding about which Edition of Akash’Bhuta this is. In Enhanced Edition (which this post seems to be about), Mountainous Carapace <em>does</em> affect damage dealt to her by limb destruction.</p>\n<p>(… and I just read much… so maybe there isn’t a misunderstanding. But I do agree that it can add up if there are 2 or 3.)</p>",
